msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:42
msgid "Project Generator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:44
msgid ""
"Choose board ``ID`` using :ref:`cmd_boards` or `Embedded Boards Explorer "
"<https://platformio.org/boards>`_ command and generate project via :option:"
"`pio project init --ide` command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:52
msgid ""
"The libraries which are added, installed or used in the project after "
"generating process won't be reflected in IDE. To fix it you need to "
"reinitialize project using :ref:`cmd_project_init` (repeat it)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:58
msgid "PlatformIO-Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:60
msgid ""
"An Emacs minor mode has been written to facilitate building and uploading "
"from within Emacs. It can be installed from the MELPA repository using ``M-x "
"package-install``. See the MELPA `Getting Started <https://melpa.org/#/"
"getting-started>`_ page for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:64
msgid ""
"Setup instructions and an example config can be found at the `Github page "
"<https://github.com/ZachMassia/platformio-mode>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:66
msgid "There are 6 predefined targets for building."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:68
msgid ""
"``platformio_build``  - Build project without auto-uploading.        (``C-c "
"i b``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:69
msgid ""
"``platformio_clean``  - Clean compiled objects.                      (``C-c "
"i c``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:70
msgid ""
"``platformio_upload`` - Build and upload (if no errors).             (``C-c "
"i u``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:71
msgid ""
"``platformio_programmer_upload`` - Build and upload using external "
"programmer (if no errors, see :ref:`atmelavr_upload_via_programmer`). (``C-c "
"i p``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:72
msgid ""
"``platformio_spiffs_upload``  - Upload files to file system SPIFFS (see :ref:"
"`platform_espressif_uploadfs`). (``C-c i s``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/emacs.rst:73
msgid ""
"``platformio_update`` - Update installed platforms and libraries.    (``C-c "
"i d``)"
msgstr ""

